                  "body/messageBody": "<p class=\"editor-paragraph\">🚨 <b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">FAILED</strong></b> <b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">FLOW ALERT</strong></b>: RMG Lost And Stolen Files To TBW to Update the X012! 🚨<br><br>Flow Name: @{workflow()?['tags']['flowDisplayName']}<br>Run ID: @{workflow()?['run']['name']}<br>Link to Run: @{concat('https://make.powerautomate.com/environments/', workflow()?['name'], '/flows/', workflow()?['tags']['logicAppName'], '/runs/', workflow()?['run']['name'])}</p>"
                },
